flowchart LR
    Pkt["skb enters ip_rcv_finish<br/><b>does:</b> brings L3 header and flow keys<br/><b>why next:</b> skb needs dst before local/forward decision<br/><b>state:</b> no usable skb_dst yet"]
    Cache{"dst already cached?<br/><b>does:</b> checks skb_dst from earlier processing<br/><b>why next:</b> cached dst can skip FIB work<br/><b>state:</b> fast path or lookup required"}
    Lookup["ip_route_input_noref<br/><b>does:</b> builds flowi key from src/dst/iif/tos/mark<br/><b>why next:</b> fib_rules choose which table sees this key<br/><b>state:</b> route lookup request"]
    Rules["fib_rules<br/><b>does:</b> walks priority-ordered policy rules<br/><b>why next:</b> matched rule names the routing table/action<br/><b>state:</b> table ID selected or fall-through"]
    Table["fib_table_lookup<br/><b>does:</b> longest-prefix match in trie<br/><b>why next:</b> nexthop/type metrics are needed to build dst<br/><b>state:</b> fib_result"]
    Rtable["build rtable<br/><b>does:</b> converts fib_result to dst operations and cacheable route<br/><b>why next:</b> skb carries dst to later stack stages<br/><b>state:</b> struct rtable with input/output callbacks"]
    Set["skb_dst_set<br/><b>does:</b> attaches route reference to skb<br/><b>why next:</b> dst->input tells IP where to send packet<br/><b>state:</b> skb owns route decision"]
    Input["dst->input<br/><b>does:</b> calls ip_local_deliver or ip_forward<br/><b>state:</b> local-vs-transit path chosen"]

    Pkt --> Cache
    Cache -->|yes: route already known| Input
    Cache -->|no: need FIB| Lookup --> Rules --> Table --> Rtable --> Set --> Input

    classDef key fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb
    classDef decision fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706
    classDef out fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a
    class Pkt,Lookup key
    class Cache,Rules,Table decision
    class Rtable,Set,Input out
